BlueSky plugin bridging the BlueSky air traffic simulator to Frequentis's
cme-manager (Conformance Monitoring Element service). Subscribes to
conformance-monitoring and conflict/separation alerts (STCA, MSAW,
RIMCAS, ACAS-RA, and more) for a configured airspace volume and tracks
them, correlating each alert to the simulated aircraft involved.

Drop-in plugin: once installed, BlueSky automatically discovers it from
the shared plugin directory. Load it with "PLUGIN LOAD FRQ_CME" (or add
FRQ_CME to enabled_plugins in settings.cfg), then toggle the bridge with
the FRQCME ON/OFF stack command.
